WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,160
What nonsense are you talking about?

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:02,360
If they were great men

3
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:05,650
I went to save Xiaoyu when I saved you

4
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:07,130
I almost got stabbed to death by that thing

5
00:00:07,370 --> 00:00:11,920
Please help me speak, just in case

6
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:17,860
You want to trick us into trusting me? I'll do it. Stop arguing.

7
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:21,300
Why is a fat man not a great man?

8
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:23,100
At least for now

9
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:25,580
No great man would cure himself of that kind of danger

10
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:32,570
If we don't save him, he will really be dead, I said.

11
00:00:32,570 --> 00:00:36,670
Ringer is still smart, you people should imitate fat people.

12
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:39,020
Back then in the Great School

13
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:40,780
You hit people at every turn

14
00:00:41,610 --> 00:00:47,220
Why are you saving someone now? Hi

15
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:48,940
In such a dangerous place
